		"description": "<p><strong>(Medium).</strong> Transform into a Medium Demon. Gain +DEX speed, Claws, Bite, Ritual Hunter. You have advantage to Hide.</p><p><strong>Claws.</strong> 1 Action, Damage: 2d4+DEX Slashing. On Crit: +LVL damage.</p><p><strong>Bite.</strong> 1 Action, Damage: 2d4+DEX Piercing. On crit: regain.</p><p><strong>Ritual Hunter.</strong> You can cast Illusion and Shadow spells while Beastshifted as The Hunger. You do not need to speak, use hand gestures, or have a free hand/spell casting focus. Spells you cast are hidden until their effect occurs.</p>",
